  "description": "Welcome to the CTF SHASTRAA 2027 Details: A nationwide Capture The Flag (CTF) competition for cybersecurity enthusiasts of every skill level. Whether you’re an experienced hacker or a curious beginner, this event is designed for you. The competition follows a Jeopardy-style CTF format , and participants may form teams of up to 2 members . Event Stages Prelims: A beginner-friendly online CTF challenge. Finals: Qualified teams from the Prelims will be invited to compete offline at IIT Madras , racing to capture flags in a high-energy, competitive environment. Challenge Categories The following categories will be featured in both stages: Web Exploitation OSINT Reverse Engineering Binary Exploitation Forensics Cryptography",
